{"id":"9190004194115561","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-dynamic-differences.md","title":"依赖枚举时钟的先入集与流入集","display":"df-dynamic-differences — 依赖枚举时钟的先入集与流入集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-dynamic-differences","aliases":["20-df-dynamic-differences"],"display":"df-dynamic-differences — 依赖枚举时钟的先入集与流入集","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 2.6.4","source_printed_pages":[47,48],"source_pdf_pages":[83,84],"depends_on":["[[20-df-one-event-clock]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-dynamic-differences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-dynamic-differences</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dynamic-differences — 依赖枚举时钟的先入集与流入集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.6.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>47</span><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>83</span><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" href=\"?note=a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" title=\"20-df-one-event-clock\">20-df-one-event-clock</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,j\\in\\omega\">\\(e,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=V_e\">\\(X=V_e\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=V_j\">\\(Y=V_j\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" href=\"?note=a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" title=\"20-df-one-event-clock\">20-df-one-event-clock</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}differences}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j):=\\{x:\\exists s\\ [x\\in V_{e,s}^a\\land x\\notin V_{j,s}^a]\\},\\\\ \\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j):=\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j)\\cap V_j.\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}differences}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j):=\\{x:\\exists s\\ [x\\in V_{e,s}^a\\land x\\notin V_{j,s}^a]\\},\\\\ \\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j):=\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j)\\cap V_j.\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Before 对应原书的动态反斜线记号，Flow 对应向下箭头。二者必须保留 a 参数；静态差集 X\\Y 与 Before 不同，后者还保留后来进入 Y 的点。单事件时钟排除不同列的同一元素同时首次出现。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.6.4；印刷页 47, 48；PDF 第 83, 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-one-event-clock","status":"resolved","id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-event-clock]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-event-clock","status":"resolved","id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Clock}(a,V)","display":false},{"tex":"e,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X=V_e","display":false},{"tex":"Y=V_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dynamic\\text{-}differences}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j):=\\{x:\\exists s\\ [x\\in V_{e,s}^a\\land x\\notin V_{j,s}^a]\\},\\\\ \\operatorname{Flow}(a;e,j):=\\operatorname{Before}(a;e,j)\\cap V_j.\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1332,"backlinks":[{"id":"7f69e9730e0b4b31","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"b6312285c945cdf9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-thm-re-proj]]。"}],"outgoing":["a7fc9a5f08d87b69"]}